  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.26 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.1.25:\n\n- fix: stop GetRange's range check overflowing for large counts [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: empty a set when ExceptWith is passed the set itself [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Rename test locals that shadow the expected field ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: make OrderedCollection.IndexOf and Remove find the first occurrence [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: remove set items from storage using the set's comparer [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
